OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CToday:FAny rain in the west quickly    
OL,6,Fclearing to the south leaving a mostly 
OL,7,Fdry day with bright and sunny spells   
OL,8,Fdeveloping from the north. Breezy      
OL,9,Faround western coasts at first but     
OL,10,Feasing later.                          
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining largely dry with    
OL,13,Fsome clear spells, allowing frost to   
OL,14,Fform overnight. There is a chance of   
OL,15,Fthe odd shower for eastern areas.      
OL,17,CFriday:FAfter a cold and frosty start, 
OL,18,Fit will be a dry day with largely      
OL,19,Fclear skies and plenty of sunshine.    
OL,20,FCloudier near eastern coasts with the  
OL,21,Fodd shower possible here.              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
