OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:        
OL,6,FContinuing with the settled theme      
OL,7,Fthrough the weekend, some sunny spells 
OL,8,Fon Saturday. Dry on Sunday and to      
OL,9,Fstart Monday, though perhaps rain      
OL,10,Farriving later. Cold with frosty       
OL,11,Fnights.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
